but not limited to, general economic conditions and other risks, uncertainties and factors set forth in the sections entitled &ldquo;Risk
Factors&rdquo; and &ldquo;Cautionary Statement Regarding Forward-Looking Statements&rdquo; in the Company&rsquo;s Annual Report on Form
20-F, and other filings it makes with the Securities and Exchange Commission. Nothing in this communication should be regarded as a representation
